{
  "id": "E012",
  "title": "Whom I Hate the Most",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2016-05-04",
  "synopsis": "Not everyone gets along, especially in a stressful work environment. In this dialogue we learn how to express those feelings.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/122/56dc10cc465e402eb01d72b8e852a3132ae82c40.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "最讨厌的人\n\nA：你们部门新来的领导怎么样？\nB：挺丑的……\nA：好相处吗？\nB：天天让我们加班，比以前更忙了。不想干了，想辞职。\nA：你这句话我听了无数次了。听说你们领导最讨厌天天说公司不好，还留在公司里的人。\nB：呵呵。我最讨厌长得像外星人，但就是赖在地球上不走的人。",
    "traditional": "最討厭的人\n\nA：你們部門新來的領導怎麼樣？\nB：挺醜的……\nA：好相處嗎？\nB：天天讓我們加班，比以前更忙了。不想幹了，想辭職。\nA：你這句話我聽了無數次了。聽說你們領導最討厭天天說公司不好，還留在公司裡的人。\nB：呵呵。我最討厭長得像外星人，但就是賴在地球上不走的人。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Whom I Hate Most"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "A：你们部门新来的领导怎么样？",
      "traditional": "A：你們部門新來的領導怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ men bù mén xīn lái de lǐng dǎo zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A: What do you think about your new leader of the department?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "B：挺丑的……",
      "traditional": "B：挺醜的……",
      "pinyin": "tǐng chǒu de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "B: She looks ugly..."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "A：好相处吗？",
      "traditional": "A：好相處嗎？",
      "pinyin": "hǎo xiāng chǔ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A: Is she easy-going?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "B：天天让我们加班，比以前更忙了。不想干了，想辞职。",
      "traditional": "B：天天讓我們加班，比以前更忙了。不想幹了，想辭職。",
      "pinyin": "tiān tiān ràng wǒ men jiā bān bǐ yǐ qián gèng máng le bù xiǎng gàn le xiǎng cí zhí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "B: Now we work overtime everyday and we're much busier than before. I've had enough, I want to resign."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "A：你这句话我听了无数次了。",
      "traditional": "A：你這句話我聽了無數次了。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ zhè jù huà wǒ tīng le wú shù cì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "听说你们领导最讨厌天天说公司不好，还留在公司里的人。",
      "traditional": "聽說你們領導最討厭天天說公司不好，還留在公司裡的人。",
      "pinyin": "tīng shuō nǐ men lǐng dǎo zuì tǎo yàn tiān tiān shuō gōng sī bù hǎo hái liú zài gōng sī lǐ de rén",
      "english": "A: I've heard this countless times."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I've heard that your leader hates people who complain about work every day but still remain in the company more than anything else."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "B：呵呵。我最讨厌长得像外星人，但就是赖在地球上不走的人。",
      "traditional": "B：呵呵。我最討厭長得像外星人，但就是賴在地球上不走的人。",
      "pinyin": "hē hē wǒ zuì tǎo yàn zhǎng de xiàng wài xīng rén dàn jiù shì lài zài dì qiú shang bù zǒu de rén",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
